  "title": "Healthier Soft Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "These healthy, chewy oatmeal cookies made with whole wheat flour, rolled oats, dates, and less sugar are a moist, tasty treat that's simple to make.",
  "authors": [
    "MakeItHealthy"
  ],
