  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.75 cup packed brown sugar",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup whole wheat flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "3 cups rolled oats",
    "1 cup diced, pitted dates"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NHtPNdYREN3YprI6LWAmkprFsF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222146-healthier-soft-oatmeal-cookies-DDMFS-step-01-c4954471ce17496bbddce522b50399ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222146/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, white sugar, and brown sugar with an electric mixer in a large bowl until smooth and creamy. Add eggs one at a time, mixing well after each addition. Mix in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/19u1hhzs88H64zL6RzhOEGFdSvM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222146-healthier-soft-oatmeal-cookies-DDMFS-step-02-214d8941ec7a459fa9791ba161d2c6b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222146/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flours, baking soda, salt, and cinnamon in a separate bowl; stir into creamed mixture. Fold in oats and dates. Cover and chill dough in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FeeuErE8nroZp9lgFPz1abmDPIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222146-healthier-soft-oatmeal-cookies-DDMFS-step-03-54e4896f08ac4831aed2179fe74dd4ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222146/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease 2 baking sheets. Roll dough into walnut-sized balls and place 2 inches apart onto the prepared baking sheets. Flatten each cookie with a large fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hHPRAG2YqRgPp_r8SiFOk2hPdMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222146-healthier-soft-oatmeal-cookies-DDMFS-step-04-ee161e8caecd4a35b29815b71877f3cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222146/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cookies are golden brown, 8 to 10 minutes. Cool cookies on the baking sheets for 5 minutes, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KHlsotNrraWJI61cNETdxyb80mc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222146-healthier-soft-oatmeal-cookies-DDMFS-step-05-44e493972e2246418b92db3badea2b24.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222146/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
